An ethical, community-based social platform designed to create safe digital spaces where people can connect, learn, and grow — free from exploitation, comparison culture, and data-driven manipulation.

Users explore verified communities through a 3D WebGL network graph (Three.js + D3-Force), with real-time messaging over MQTT and a NestJS REST API backed by PostgreSQL.
